@startuml 03-stripe-checkout-flow-current
!theme plain
title Stripe Checkout Flow - Current Implementation

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor Customer as C
participant "Browser" as B
participant "StripeOrderController" as SOC
participant "EventDispatcher" as ED
participant "StripeCheckoutSessionHandler" as SCSH
participant "Stripe API" as Stripe #FFE0B2
participant "StripeCheckoutReturnHandler" as SCRH
participant "PaymentAuthorizedEventHandler" as PAEH
participant "StripeOrderCreationHandler" as SOCH
participant "OxidShopOrderService" as SOS
participant "Order::finalizeOrder()" as FO
participant "Contract" as Contract #E1F5FE
database "oxorder" as DB

== Phase 1: Checkout Session Creation ==

C -> B: Click "Pay with Stripe"
B -> SOC: createCheckoutSession()

SOC -> ED: dispatch(StripeCheckoutSessionRequestEvent)
ED -> SCSH: handle()

SCSH -> Contract: Create (DRAFT)
SCSH -> Stripe: Create Checkout Session
Stripe --> SCSH: session_id, checkout_url
SCSH -> Contract: Save metadata\n(delivery_hash, basket_snapshot)
SCSH -> Contract: Transition to PENDING

Contract --> SOC: session_id

SOC --> B: JSON { id, url }
B -> Stripe: Redirect to Hosted Checkout

== Phase 2: Payment on Stripe (External) ==

C -> Stripe: Enter payment details
C -> Stripe: Confirm payment
Stripe -> Stripe: Process payment
note right of Stripe
    PaymentIntent created
    Payment captured
end note

Stripe --> B: Redirect to success_url\n?session_id=cs_xxx&contract_id=xxx&contract_token=xxx

== Phase 3: Return Handling ==

B -> SOC: checkoutSuccess()
SOC -> ED: dispatch(StripeCheckoutReturnEvent)
ED -> SCRH: handle()

SCRH -> SCRH: Validate session_id, contract_id, token
SCRH -> Contract: Load by ID
SCRH -> SCRH: Restore session state\n(sDelAddrMD5, deladrid)
SCRH -> ED: dispatch(PaymentAuthorizedEvent)

ED -> PAEH: handle()
PAEH -> Contract: fulfillCondition('payment_authorized')
PAEH -> Contract: Transition to READY_TO_COMMIT
PAEH -> ED: dispatch(ContractReadyToCommitEvent)

== Phase 4: Order Creation ==

ED -> SOCH: handle()
SOCH -> SOCH: Validate contract state

group #FFF3E0 THE CRITICAL SECTION
    SOCH -> SOS: createOrder(request)
    SOS -> FO: finalizeOrder($basket, $user)

    note right of FO
        **Inside finalizeOrder:**
        1. Check order exists (sess_challenge)
        2. Validate basket/user/delivery
        3. Save order (NOT_FINISHED)
        4. executePayment() -> TRUE (Stripe override)
        5. Set order number
        6. Set status OK
        7. Send emails
    end note

    FO -> DB: INSERT oxorder
    FO --> SOS: ORDER_STATE_OK
end

SOS --> SOCH: OrderResponse

SOCH -> Contract: commitToOrder(orderId)
SOCH -> Contract: Transition to COMMITTED
SOCH -> DB: Update OXPAID timestamp

SOCH --> SOC: orderId in context

SOC -> B: Redirect to "thankyou"

== Potential Issue: Webhook Race ==

note over Stripe, SCRH
    **RACE CONDITION**

    Webhook (payment_intent.succeeded) may arrive
    BEFORE user returns from Stripe.

    If webhook handler tries to create order:
    - Contract not yet COMMITTED
    - Order might not exist
    - Must handle gracefully
end note

@enduml
